;. /inspect_procedure_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition inspect_procedure
  ;= Inspect an authored Semidoc draft
    Bind an own-record capture of the actual resulting Nenex page. The result is the native document record, exact source and version, with its action receipts. Read the extraction provenance and input cells through their existing namespace addresses. Publication and resolution of an extraction authoring hole remain separate decisions.

    ;@ /flow/input capture
    ;= capture

    ;@ /flow/input receipts
    ;= receipts

    ;@ /flow/step draft ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/inspect_document
    ;@ /flow/bind capture capture
    ;@ /flow/bind receipts receipts
    ;= draft

    ;@ /flow/result draft
    ;= Inspect an authored Semidoc draft result
